==Trivia==
*Michelangelo Cat's name in The Battle Cats POP!, David Cat, is a reference to the [[wikipedia:Michelangelo|Michelangelo]] sculpture ''[[wikipedia:David (Michelangelo)|David]]''.
*Strangely, Gentleman Cat and Dancing Flasher Cat are both named Flasher Cat in The Battle Cats POP!.
*Some cats which are Special Cats in BCEN are Super Rare Cats in The Battle Cats POP!. Examples include Moneko and Bean Cats.

